ROJ_NETWORK, PROJ_NETWORK_ENDPOINT, cache settings and the user-writable directory can change the effective transformation resources."],"decision":"Record network enabled state before/during/after, endpoint, user-writable directory, cache.db path/hash/size/mtime, downloaded resource identity and whether the chosen operation was fully local or network-assisted."},{"id":"GDAL_RUNTIME_CONFIG_BINARY_AND_DRIVER_PROVENANCE","sources":["https://gdal.org/en/stable/user/configoptions.html","https://gdal.org/en/stable/api/cpl.html"],"facts":["GDAL runtime configuration can come from environment variables, configuration files, global options and thread-local options.","Programmatic GDAL configuration can override environment values.","Configuration options can change driver behavior and cache, georeferencing and I/O semantics."],"decision":"Persist GDAL version/build info, loaded shared-library and executable hashes where discoverable, driver registry identity, GDAL_CONFIG_FILE hash and a redacted allowlisted snapshot of relevant global/thread/environment options."},{"id":"PYTHON_DISTRIBUTION_MODULE_AND_EXECUTABLE_PROVENANCE","sources":["https://docs.python.org/3/library/importlib.metadata.html","https://docs.python.org/3/library/platform.html"],"facts":["importlib.metadata exposes installed distribution versions, files and recorded file hashes when installation metadata is available.","module-to-distribution mapping can be inspected, while editable installs may lack complete top-level mapping.","Python platform APIs expose interpreter architecture and compiler identity."],"decision":"Persist Python executable path/SHA-256, implementation/cache tag/compiler/architecture, imported module file paths/SHA-256, owning distributions, versions, direct_url/editable state, RECORD availability and an aggregate distribution-file manifest hash."},{"id":"NUMPY_RUNTIME_BACKEND_HASH_AND_RANDOMNESS_REPRODUCIBILITY","sources":["https://numpy.org/doc/stable/reference/generated/numpy.show_config